Project Name

E-Commerce Daily Data Pipeline & Analytics Platform

Business Scenario

An e-commerce company receives daily transactional data from its operational systems. The Data Engineering team needs to ingest, validate, transform, and load this data into an analytics-ready environment.

Management needs reporting for:

